    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d349">

                <pb facs="0490" n="480" sameAs="frus:frus1945v03/pg480"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">800.602/4–1845</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in the United
                        Kingdom</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Winant</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 5341</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-04-18">April 18, 1945</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Secretary of State transmits, for the information and guidance of the
                    Ambassador, a document regarding the policy of this Government toward German
                    participation in international cartels. The recommendations set forth in the
                    document have been approved by <pb facs="0491" n="481" xml:id="pg481"/> the
                    Executive Committee on Economic Foreign Policy, with the concurrence of
                    representatives of the War and Navy Departments, and are intended to serve as a
                    basis for discussions with the allied governments represented on the European
                    Advisory Committee.</p>


                <xi:include href="d349-a1.xml" xpointer="d349-a1"/>
            </div>
